 is MUCH more fun with friends. You always gotta have someone by your side while playing a multiplayer game of course!\n\nGo wild with anything, ape.", "short_description": "Welcome to Seeking Apes!\n\nIn this game, you are an ape (obviously) and you can do whatever you want! But don't do bad things of course."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/seeking-apes-privacy-policy/home", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "MrDolphin & GORILLANUTT", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/seeking-apes-info/home", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "2691890164460465"}, {"id": "528142316460358"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["MULTI_USER"], "id": "24273920698902196"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/507827918_2729545013907123_1723227086575873121_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=dYA6DX7GMUcQ7kNvwG0awb7&_nc_oc=Adp9hGjTQVJXCy9VEbEUnctcPZ4wFXOyATLZ1g48kprBRebzk7gQha4x_ytew9RVr74&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRI0GrzrHtlud6WQSC0fQQDwpxGMYePkBYvOPoL9lXFLg&oe=6AF878C2"}, "is_concept": false, "is_test": false, "is_trial_offer_valid": false, "display_name": "Seeking Apes", "platform": "ANDROID_6DOF", "context_category": {"context_category": "GAMES", "id": "274